  "description": "PDF toolkit for .NET — find/replace, merge, split, and build PDFs from scratch. Operates directly on PDF content streams with zero external dependencies.\n\nFeatures: text find/replace (regex, case-insensitive, whole-word), PDF merging, page splitting/extraction, fluent document builder (text, images, shapes), text extraction, document inspection. Width-aware text fitting preserves layout on replacement.\n\nThe netstandard2.0 build is compatible with .NET Framework 4.6.1+, .NET Core 2.0+, and .NET 5/6/7/8+. The net8.0 build is optimized for modern .NET. NuGet resolves automatically.\n\nMade in USA.",
